{"id": "airport-electrical-one-bidder", "title": "Airport airfield electrical contract: one bid, from the firm that held the last one", "seconds": 139.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "a689c978b9c5548b", "words": 422, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[7]"], "text": "October 2026. The Airport opens bids for years of airfield electrical work.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.15, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s2", "kicker": "Abstract of bids · agreement 12184.51 · opened 2 October 2026", "text": "1 bid: BASS Electric, $5,658,182", "mark": "1 bid"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.7, 1.52, 2.11, 2.46, 2.79, 3.03, 3.2, 3.58, 3.72, 4.11, 4.59]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "How many bids came in?", "t0": 5.27, "t1": 7.16, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s2", "kicker": "Abstract of bids · agreement 12184.51 · opened 2 October 2026", "text": "1 bid: BASS Electric, $5,658,182", "mark": "1 bid"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.24, 0.49, 0.72]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "amount"], "text": "One.", "t0": 7.16, "t1": 7.99, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "1", "label": "bid received", "sub": "BASS Electric, $5,658,182"}, "emph": ["One"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[0].what", "timeline[5]"], "text": "And it was round two: in July, every first-round bid was rejected.", "t0": 8.51, "t1": 12.44, "shot": "b1a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Contract No. 12184.50", "kicker": "21 July 2026", "sub": "all bids rejected; re-advertised as 12184.51"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.15, 0.31, 0.65, 1.3, 1.47, 2.04, 2.38, 2.97, 3.17, 3.38]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 12.56, "t1": 14.02, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.15, 0.26, 0.81, 0.95, 1.03]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "amount"], "text": "The one bid: 5,658,182 dollars.", "t0": 14.24, "t1": 17.64, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["The one bid", "$5,658,182"], "b": ["Engineer’s estimate", "$5,008,115"]}, "emph": ["5,658,182"], "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.31, 0.72, 1.29, 1.61, 1.95, 2.28, 2.76]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "amount"], "text": "The engineer’s estimate: 5,008,115.", "t0": 17.76, "t1": 20.07, "shot": "b3x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["The one bid", "$5,658,182"], "b": ["Engineer’s estimate", "$5,008,115"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.49, 1.07, 1.61, 1.82]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "That’s 113 percent of the estimate.", "t0": 20.19, "t1": 22.31, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["The one bid", "$5,658,182"], "b": ["Engineer’s estimate", "$5,008,115"]}, "emph": ["113 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.37, 0.64, 0.98, 1.31, 1.42, 1.53]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "And on 16 of its 31 priced lines, the bid equals the estimate to the dollar.", "t0": 22.43, "t1": 26.82, "shot": "b3y", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "16 of 31", "label": "priced lines equal to the estimate, to the dollar", "sub": "$1,368,700 of estimate value"}, "emph": ["16 of its 31"], "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.24, 0.63, 0.75, 0.88, 1.37, 1.72, 2.47, 2.59, 2.83, 3.14, 3.23, 3.65, 3.82, 3.97]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why", "innocent[3]"], "text": "A renewal estimate often uses the current prices, which this bidder holds.", "t0": 26.94, "t1": 30.68, "shot": "b3z", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "how the estimate was built and who had seen it"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.43, 0.78, 1.11, 1.36, 1.48, 1.73, 2.49, 2.68, 2.83, 3.12]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "With one bidder, there’s no price competition, on a frame for years of work orders.", "t0": 30.8, "t1": 35.07, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a frame for years of work orders"}, "emph": ["no price competition"], "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.37, 0.69, 0.91, 1.04, 1.32, 2.31, 2.43, 2.52, 2.85, 3.06, 3.38, 3.51, 3.73]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "timeline[2]"], "text": "The second lead. Who held the last airfield electrical agreement, from 2021 to 2026?", "t0": 35.29, "t1": 41.52, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Agreement 1000022051", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "2021-07-27 to 2026-07-29", "chip": "as-needed airfield electrical"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.47, 1.03, 1.77, 1.95, 2.05, 2.32, 2.71, 3.17, 3.83, 3.97, 4.24, 4.69, 4.89, 5.04]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[1]"], "text": "BASS Electric. The bidder itself.", "t0": 41.52, "t1": 44.1, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "BASS Electric", "label": "prime on the previous agreement", "sub": "BAY AREA SYST & SLTNS INC DBA BASS ELEC"}, "emph": ["BASS Electric"], "wt": [0.04, 0.63, 1.44, 1.67, 1.91]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]", "suspicious[1].what", "timeline[1]"], "text": "It won that one in 2021 on the only bid, too.", "t0": 44.52, "t1": 47.23, "shot": "b6a", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,999,478", "label": "Contract No. 11643.50 · 6 April 2021", "sub": "the only bid received"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.28, 0.48, 0.62, 0.74, 0.95, 1.51, 1.66, 1.76, 2.04, 2.38]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]", "suspicious[1].what", "timeline[1]"], "text": "3,999,478 dollars.", "t0": 47.35, "t1": 48.78, "shot": "b6a", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,999,478", "label": "Contract No. 11643.50 · 6 April 2021", "sub": "the only bid received"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.41, 0.76]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "Its subcontractor, Royal Electric, was listed for 1,642,642 dollars.", "t0": 48.9, "t1": 53.55, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["BASS Electric, prime’s own share", "$1,631,945"], "b": ["Royal Electric, its subcontractor", "$1,642,642"]}, "emph": ["1,642,642"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 1.02, 1.29, 2.07, 2.22, 2.54, 2.67, 2.87, 3.03, 3.34, 3.5, 3.95]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[1]"], "text": "More than the prime’s own share: 1,631,945.", "t0": 53.67, "t1": 56.65, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["BASS Electric, prime’s own share", "$1,631,945"], "b": ["Royal Electric, its subcontractor", "$1,642,642"]}, "emph": ["More than"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.25, 0.34, 0.67, 0.82, 1.47, 1.7, 1.94, 2.23, 2.49]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "story[3]"], "text": "BASS was prime on 6 Airport contracts, and a subcontractor on 27.", "t0": 56.77, "t1": 61.23, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Prime on 6 Airport contracts", "sub": "a subcontractor on 27, 10 of them under Schembri Construction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.43, 0.76, 0.93, 1.23, 1.64, 2.53, 2.61, 2.7, 3.42, 3.55]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "count", "ref": ["story[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "The City has paid it 5,968,881 dollars since fiscal 2019,", "t0": 61.35, "t1": 64.98, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "$5,968,881", "label": "paid by the City since fiscal 2019", "sub": "all but $17,577 through the Airport"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.32, 0.46, 0.67, 0.8, 1.07, 1.26, 1.54, 1.92, 2.14, 2.46, 2.74]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "count", "ref": ["story[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "all but 17,577 of it through the Airport.", "t0": 64.98, "t1": 68.37, "shot": "b9x", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "$5,968,881", "label": "paid by the City since fiscal 2019", "sub": "all but $17,577 through the Airport"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.43, 0.84, 1.3, 1.48, 1.7, 2.3, 2.43, 2.55, 2.74, 2.84]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "An incumbent as the only bidder is when competition most needs checking.", "t0": 68.49, "t1": 71.98, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the situation in which competition most needs checking"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.52, 0.65, 0.8, 1.07, 1.43, 1.52, 1.72, 2.29, 2.66, 2.93]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "timeline[4]"], "text": "The third lead. In July 2026, on a cable job, the two bid against each other.", "t0": 72.2, "t1": 77.67, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Royal Electric Company", "$2,770,000"], "b": ["BASS Electric", "$3,433,451"], "kicker": "5kV cable job 10672.61 · July 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.98, 1.67, 1.97, 2.23, 2.93, 3.1, 3.19, 3.55, 4.22, 4.32, 4.5, 4.64, 4.97, 5.18]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Royal Electric, 2,770,000 dollars.", "t0": 77.79, "t1": 81.05, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Royal Electric Company", "$2,770,000"], "b": ["BASS Electric", "$3,433,451"], "kicker": "5kV cable job 10672.61 · July 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 1.24, 1.49, 1.66, 2.02, 2.19, 2.73]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "BASS, 3,433,451.", "t0": 81.17, "t1": 83.17, "shot": "b11x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Royal Electric Company", "$2,770,000"], "b": ["BASS Electric", "$3,433,451"], "kicker": "5kV cable job 10672.61 · July 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.64, 0.9, 1.11, 1.36, 1.53]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "timeline[0]"], "text": "Yet on Airport contracts, each has been prime with the other as its subcontractor.", "t0": 83.29, "t1": 87.03, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "1000004028 · 2017", "sub": "Royal Electric prime, BASS a subcontractor"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "1000022051 · 2021", "sub": "BASS prime, Royal Electric a subcontractor"}], "kicker": "Airport contracts"}, "emph": ["each"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.24, 0.59, 1.24, 1.42, 1.51, 1.72, 2.03, 2.15, 2.24, 2.53, 2.7, 2.86]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[6]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "The Airport’s minutes tie the City’s payee Royal Electric to Vellutini Corporation, trading as Royal Electric Company.", "t0": 87.15, "t1": 93.05, "shot": "b12n", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "with Vellutini Corporation dba Royal Electric Company", "kicker": "Airport Commission minutes, 19 June 2018"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.46, 0.72, 0.86, 1.0, 1.34, 1.76, 2.15, 2.69, 2.86, 3.35, 4.22, 4.49, 4.68, 5.0, 5.41]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[4]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "Whether the 2026 bidder is that same company, the records do not show.", "t0": 93.17, "t1": 97.28, "shot": "b12a", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the records still do not show whether the bidder is that company or another with the same name"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.26, 0.47, 1.01, 1.28, 1.41, 1.62, 1.88, 2.58, 2.69, 3.17, 3.35, 3.57]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Firms that bid against each other and work for each other can share information on price.", "t0": 97.4, "t1": 101.08, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "can share information on price"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.43, 0.57, 0.84, 1.04, 1.3, 1.44, 1.63, 1.76, 1.91, 2.18, 2.37, 2.57, 2.98, 3.14]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "The fourth lead. On that cable job, the estimate was 5,061,900 dollars.", "t0": 101.3, "t1": 106.11, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Job 10672.61", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "4 bids · estimate $5,061,900"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.4, 1.04, 1.69, 1.84, 2.13, 2.42, 2.5, 2.83, 2.98, 3.24, 3.44, 3.7, 3.85, 4.26]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]"], "text": "The lowest bid?", "t0": 106.23, "t1": 106.99, "shot": "b14x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Job 10672.61", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "4 bids · estimate $5,061,900"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.38]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "2,494,000 dollars. 49 percent.", "t0": 106.99, "t1": 110.19, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2,494,000", "label": "TJ Gardner Company", "sub": "49% of the estimate"}, "emph": ["49 percent"], "wt": [0.04, 0.61, 0.72, 1.02, 1.18, 1.59, 2.31, 2.72]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "The second bid, Royal Electric’s, was 55 percent.", "t0": 110.71, "t1": 113.44, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2,494,000", "label": "TJ Gardner Company", "sub": "49% of the estimate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.33, 0.71, 0.97, 1.58, 1.77, 2.18]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Either the estimate was far off, or the bid may not cover the work.", "t0": 113.56, "t1": 116.56, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a bid too low to perform can be rejected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.3, 0.63, 0.78, 1.0, 1.56, 1.63, 1.78, 1.97, 2.1, 2.24, 2.48, 2.61]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "And TJ Gardner Company doesn’t appear in the City’s payment or contract files.", "t0": 116.68, "t1": 120.23, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a bid too low to perform can be rejected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.43, 0.72, 1.11, 1.52, 1.71, 1.82, 1.91, 2.17, 2.51, 2.64, 3.08]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The portal says awarded, but not to whom. Nothing shows the bidders coordinated prices.", "t0": 120.45, "t1": 125.34, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Whether 12184.51 was awarded to the single bidder, or bid again", "Why the first round (12184.50) was rejected, and who bid in it", "That the bidders coordinated their prices"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.67, 1.5, 1.63, 1.78, 1.93, 2.38, 3.18, 3.42, 3.5, 3.77, 4.28]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The award notice, plan holders, and airfield bids from 2015 to 2025.", "t0": 125.46, "t1": 132.01, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The award notice, any bid protest and the plan holders for 12184.51"}, {"who": "", "what": "Airport bid tabulations for airfield electrical work, 2015-2025"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.25, 0.54, 0.87, 1.33, 1.67, 2.53, 2.8, 3.64, 3.81, 4.21, 4.5, 4.64, 4.86, 5.3, 5.5, 5.71]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "innocent[0]", "defense[0]"], "text": "Airfield work is a narrow specialty. A single bid alleges nothing against the bidder.", "t0": 132.13, "t1": 136.37, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.55, 0.67, 0.75, 1.1, 2.01, 2.28, 2.57, 2.81, 3.15, 3.47, 3.72, 3.82]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 136.49, "t1": 138.94, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.36, 0.49, 0.57, 1.38, 1.63, 1.78]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "One bid", "lead1": "Lead 1 · 113% of the estimate", "lead2": "Lead 2 · the incumbent", "lead3": "Lead 3 · rivals and partners", "lead4": "Lead 4 · half the estimate", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "map", "hook": "document"}